---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | Sola Hair Salon"
  description="Independence and affiliation disclaimer for Sola Hair Salon."
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Sola Hair Salon is an independent informational resource covering the
      salon-studio industry, hair services, hairstyles and hair care. It is not an
      official Sola Salon Studios website and is not affiliated with, sponsored by,
      or endorsed by Sola Salon Studios unless explicitly stated on a specific page.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Pricing figures produced by our calculators are estimates for informational
      purposes only and are not official prices from Sola Salon Studios or any
      individual professional. Hair growth estimates are general and not medical
      advice. For scalp or health-related concerns, consult a qualified healthcare
      professional.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      Trademarks referenced on this site belong to their respective owners and are
      used only to accurately describe the subject of our content.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
